          </h3>
          <dl class="grid gap-5 border-t border-line pt-5 text-sm leading-7">
            <div>
              <dt class="font-mono text-xs text-red uppercase font-bold">Shannon Entropy (1948)</dt>
              <dd class="m-0 text-muted">H = −∑ p log p</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="border-t border-dashed border-line pt-4">
              <dt class="font-mono text-xs text-blue uppercase font-bold">
                Cross-Entropy Loss (1950s–)
              </dt>
              <dd class="m-0 text-muted">
                H(p,q) = −∑ p log q<br />
                模型訓練的損失函數
              </dd>
            </div>
            <div class="border-t border-dashed border-line pt-4">
              <dt class="font-mono text-xs text-blue uppercase font-bold">Perplexity</dt>
              <dd class="m-0 text-muted">
                = 2<sup>H(p, q)</sup>
                <br />
                語言模型標準評估指標
              </dd>
            </div>
            <div class="border-t border-dashed border-line pt-4">
              <dt class="font-mono text-xs text-ink uppercase font-bold">GPT / LLaMA / Gemini</dt>
              <dd class="m-0 text-muted">每次訓練更新參數，最小化的就是這個 H</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
        </aside>
      </PaperReadingLayout>
    </section>

